S("State two similarities among ruminants",2,"Any two of: they are kept by people for food and other products, they need clean water and shelter, each has a digestive system that breaks food down into small substances, and their waste can be used as manure.","Kept for food or other products::food,products,meat,milk|Need water and shelter::water,shelter|Digest food into small substances::digestive system,digest,break food|Waste can be used as manure::manure,waste"),
